</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/0b13626c-dc4d-11f1-847f-a575454bc579/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-6b650de8.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/0b13626c-dc4d-11f1-847f-a575454bc579/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-6b650de8.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">9e30ed04-dc4c-11f1-a950-83d2f8bc81e0</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 15:26:10 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>AI, affair and espionage: Why is Nvidia's chief Jensen Huang under scrutiny?</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-ai-affair-and-espionage-why-is-nvidia-s-chief-jensen-huang-under-scrutiny</link><description>
