</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d8cd174a-dc2d-11f1-91f1-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/mini1-4.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d8cd174a-dc2d-11f1-91f1-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/mini1-4.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">152246fc-dc2e-11f1-a711-f5910a563915</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 11:45:31 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>Trump says deportation crackdown was 'too tough' after midterm setback</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-trump-says-deportation-crackdown-was-too-tough-after-midterm-setback</link><description>
